{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:40 2026-11-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:40 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:40 2026-11-24 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4359f32d35d8ed25953410cc6dc732a/2026-11/002_14.png\"/><p>今日（24日）下午3時許，警方接獲報案，指一名1.5歲大女嬰在昂坪360纜車上暈倒，昏迷不醒。救援人員接報到場，隨即替她進行急救，其後恢復清醒，並由飛行服務隊直升機送往東區醫院檢查。</p><p>據了解，女童當時與父母於東涌纜車總站乘搭纜車前往昂坪，其間疑不適暈倒。</p><img alt=\"女童送院時已恢復清醒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f0e1b1e5a81e209500f98078c18e371/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_16_14_21_1_.jpeg\" title=\"女童送院時已恢復清醒。\"/><p>女童送院時已恢復清醒。</p><img alt=\"女童的父親亦陪同送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df3aa748e6b874dfe4fdf0e5fc17af14/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-24_at_16_14_21.jpeg\" title=\"女童的父親亦陪同送院。\"/><p>女童的父親亦陪同送院。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T09:04:02.771028+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:40:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:17:23.099773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:57:21.392412+00:00","content_hash":"9d74d122a3d2a7848f864994fd062a9e99b780a175f51d1b5e0a9a4ae4ac361e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}